# Code owners for depmesh-ai.
#
# Ownership is repository-wide: one maintainer, no sub-team boundaries worth
# drawing yet. Split this by path only when someone else owns an area in
# practice, not in anticipation.
#
# Note on branch protection: naming an owner here does NOT let that owner
# approve their own pull requests — GitHub forbids self-approval regardless of
# CODEOWNERS. With "require code owner reviews" and a minimum of 1 approval, a
# solo maintainer cannot satisfy the requirement on their own PRs at all. To
# merge unaided, set the required approval count to 0 (pull requests and status
# checks still apply) or rely on an admin bypass.

